  title: "Tissue Packet Reservation (\u201CChope\u201D Culture) - 1980s "
  info: "A uniquely Singaporean habit, \u201Cchope-ing\u201D involves placing a tissue
    packet on a seat to reserve it in crowded hawker centers. This practice reflects
    Singaporeans\u2019 pragmatic approach to securing seats while dining out.  "
